    "created_at": "2024-06-24T19:23:13Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-06-24T19:23:13Z",
    "body": "Proposal:\r\n\r\n1. https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/5998\r\nNew appearance property value for interoperable and styleable form control elements\r\n\r\n2. https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/10380\r\nDOM/Box structure for appearance:base-select\r\n\r\n3. https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/9144\r\nThe anchor attribute\r\n\r\n4. https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/10242\r\nHow to implement the `<selectedoption>` element\r\n\r\n5. https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/10028\r\nChanging UA styles based on the computed value of the appearance property\r\n\r\n6. https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/9625 ([PR 9841](https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/9841))  (Maybe just WHATNOT?) The `invoketarget` attribute (with bikeshed name) for popover and dialog\r\n\r\n7. https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/9778\r\nPopover=hint behavior\r\n",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
